ected artifact in the remaining submission attempt without fabricating a structural acceptance.\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"The latest submit_artifact feedback was WITNESS-EXISTENCE: R001. No successful artifact check or submission occurred.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"Read all four frozen task documents and the linked NL0 v2 rules. The proof draft's compact-support, differentiation-under-a-uniform-limit, integration-by-parts, and tangency route was preserved in attempted graph submissions. The first structural rejection identified undeclared locals; the second identified missing local witness-existence evidence. No Audit A was performed, and FTC/Fubini sources were not registered.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"requir